## The bleachers

::bg{location="track" time="night"}
::auto{character="mika" anchor="center" action="fadeInUp"}
@mika{emotion="sad"}: The scout from the mainland came. He watched me walk. He left before I sat down.
@mika{emotion="hurt"}: If I'm not the fast one, I don't know which one I am.
@mika{emotion="fond" when="holds(cleared(mika, bittersweet))"}: Weird. I feel like I've sat here before and said the wrong thing. You too?

<branch id="mikaAsk" prompt="Mika is looking at his shoes.">
  <choice id="more" label="Tell him he's the one who makes everyone laugh at the finish line">
    @mika{emotion="happy"}: ...Yeah? Yeah. That one. I can be that one.
    ::set{run.aff.mika += 1}
  </choice>
  <choice id="heal" label="Tell him he'll be fast again by spring">
    @mika{emotion="neutral"}: Sure. By spring. Everyone keeps saying spring.
    ::set{run.aff.mika -= 1}
  </choice>
</branch>
